---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:32px;max-width:760px;min-height:50vh">
    <h1 class="serif" style="font-size:48px;margin:0 0 16px">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.65">[PLACEHOLDER: your privacy policy. It must explain that lead form details (name, email, phone, wedding date, guest count, budget, message) are shared with the vendors a couple contacts or is matched with, how long data is kept, how to request deletion, and that the site uses Google Analytics, Google Ads and the Meta Pixel (cookies) to measure visits and ads, with links to opt out. Have this reviewed by a lawyer before launch.]</p>
  </main>
</Base>
